`aplan init` scaffolds a starter `.aplan.yml`. Writing it is covered by the
`aplan-config` unit tests (the scaffold loads as the default); here we pin the guard
that makes it safe to run, it refuses to overwrite a policy the repo already has.

```
$ aplan init
? 2
aplan: .aplan.yml already exists at ./.aplan.yml; refusing to overwrite

```
